  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 350\u00179 F (180\u00179 C).",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the flour, baking powder, and salt.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together the yogurt, honey, and vanilla extract.",
    "Add the flour mixture to the wet ingredients and stir until just combined.",
    "Gently fold in the currants and walnuts.",
    "Transfer the batter to a wooden board and smooth the top.",
    "Bake for 25 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Remove from the oven and let cool for 5 minutes.",
    "Serve warm, sliced into wedges.",
    "Garnish with additional currants and walnuts if desired."
